.TH SESSPROBE 1
.SH NAME
sessprobe \- exercise session and process-group syscalls
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sessprobe
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sessprobe
is a guest regression probe for POSIX-shaped session and process-group
behavior. It checks getsid, setsid, getpgid, setpgid, tcgetpgrp, tcsetpgrp,
child inheritance, terminal foreground groups, and invalid-argument failures.
